      <p class="standfirst">Hatchet is a creator-marketing and live-streaming analytics platform for gaming. Its marketing site has to explain a four-stage product to brands, game publishers, agencies and esports organisers, then get them to book a demo. I led the rebuild and the redesign: a new visual language, a static site with no server to maintain, and guardrails that let the marketing team edit it safely.</p>
